WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.218
Start a new MagicSchool rubric. (3× speed)

00:00:00.218 --> 00:00:00.643
Choose University and four levels. (3× speed)

00:00:00.643 --> 00:00:13.037
Enter the approved brief and short source distinctions; PDF upload unavailable. (3× speed)

00:00:13.037 --> 00:00:15.585
Read the complete approved brief; short source distinctions only.

00:00:15.585 --> 00:00:16.187
Generate the rubric from the approved brief. (3× speed)

00:00:16.187 --> 00:00:16.430
Generate from the approved brief and short source distinctions. (4× speed)

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:24.313
Review the first rubric across all four levels.

00:00:24.313 --> 00:00:24.489
Refine to 18 words per descriptor and a genuinely unaided explanation.

00:00:24.489 --> 00:00:41.083
Focus the native refinement field

00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:41.963
Generate the revised rubric

00:00:41.963 --> 00:00:42.106
Generate the concise observable descriptors. (4× speed)

00:00:42.106 --> 00:00:54.166
Read the revised three-criterion rubric across four levels.

00:00:54.166 --> 00:00:55.023
Export the reviewed final rubric

00:00:55.023 --> 00:00:55.643
Choose Microsoft Word and review Selected Resource.

00:00:55.643 --> 00:00:56.612
Open Microsoft Word export options

00:00:56.612 --> 00:00:57.934
Export the selected final rubric as the original Word file.

00:00:57.934 --> 00:00:58.617
Download the selected final rubric as Word
